column2:
name of where element/link lives, e.g. "footer" / "contact page" / "maturity tool" / "scoping tool" / "The Cycle of UX Data" / "Toolkit Highlights" / "review feedback quotes" / "Quarterly Department Review work sample" / "Skills + Tools" / "AI - Hours Saved" / "Skills + Tools - Leadership + Operations"; 
or name of the nav type, e.g. "static"/ "hamburger"; 
or name of the footer section, e.g. "Get in Touch" / "Explore" / "logo"

form name, e.g. "contact form"; 
or name of aligning interaction item, e.g. "Data collection" / "Strategy" / "Ecommerce"; 
or name of modal, e.g. "Department Turnaround and Growth Case Study" / "Executive Dashboard Work Sample" / "Maturity Framework Tool"; 
or filter name, e.g. "Area" / "Search Term" / "Hostname"; 
or name of element tied to hover, e.g. "5h Tracking Document Scaffolding" / "Opportunity Identification"

type of element, e.g. "link" / "button" / "icon"; 
or type of interaction, e.g. "dropdown selection" / "submit for result" / "checkbox selection" / "selections wide-span update" / "multi-choice button selection" / "selectable option" / "search bar"; 
or category of modal, e.g. "Case Study" / "Work Sample" / "Tool"; 
or type of info hover value, e.g. "Reinvested Into" / "Basic Level" / "Level With Note"
